        "original_id": "1ca473d7-9b8f-5329-a86a-0f570e82da89",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Discovery Zone, Valentino's, Leaps and Bounds, The Amazing Pizza Machine\n- Places: Kansas City, Missouri, Lincoln, Nebraska\n- Products: indoor mazes, roller slides, climbing play structures, ball pits\n\nFacts:\n- Discovery Zone was a chain of entertainment facilities for young children that featured games, indoor mazes, roller slides, climbing play structures, and ball pits.\n- The first Discovery Zone location opened in Kansas City, Missouri, in October 1989.\n- Leaps and Bounds merged with competitor Discovery Zone in 1995.\n- Valentino's is a regional Italian restaurant chain based in Lincoln, Nebraska.\n- The Amazing Pizza Machine is owned in part by the co-owners of Valentino's Pizza.",
